window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>A woman in the shadow of the new moon…</b> <br> <br> Lumen Fenn was torn down by the men who took possession of her home and has sequestered herself in the Lunar Convent, searching for peace. But being left an empty vessel of a woman makes room to be filled by new forces. Called on by her Goddess, Lumen must return to the land and the men she fled. <br> <br> <b>Three men burning under the sun’s glare…</b> <br> <br> Can harm be undone? Dominic, Finley, and Gideon realized too late what their possession of Lumen’s home and body cost her, and what it cost their own hearts. When Lumen returns, transformed and impenetrable, will they fight to claim the woman they desire or retreat and lose her completely? <br> <br> <b>Four souls connected by the forces of Sol &amp; Lune.</b> <br> <br> This is the conclusion of the Sol &amp; Lune duet, at 120K words with an HEA.</p>"; 
